          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "适合信号：能在重复节拍下持续核批次、规格、数量和设备状态。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "谨慎条件：若容易越过防护、带故障操作或为赶产量省略记录，应先做纸面分流练习。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全试做只用四条虚构工单，不接近或操作真实设备。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
