      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.faq-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "核心工作包括检查缺陷与规格、记录产量、称量标记、送料下料、转运堆放，并在授权范围内启停或调整设备。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "送料下料工围绕材料进出与记录；机械维修工修理设备，轧制、切割冲压、磨削和铣削岗位分别设定或操作特定加工设备。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "adj-cut",
                  "adj-grind",
                  "adj-mech",
                  "adj-mill",
                  "adj-roll",
                  "onet"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "适配证据来自能否在重复节拍下持续核规格、识别缺陷、正确记录，并在防护或设备状态不清时停手。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "AI可辅助核对工单、提示批次字段和汇总产量，但不能确认现场防护、设备隔离、材料状态或启动许可。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "人员必须现场确认设备状态、护罩、急停、材料规格、交接与授权；工具不得远程替人启动或解除隔离。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "本次国家统计局行业和人员类别工资材料未建立与O*NET 53-7063.00一一对应的中国全国单职业工资分布。",
                "fact_refs": [
                  "cn-gap"
                ],
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial",
                  "nbs"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国O*NET转引BLS 2025年数据：该职业年薪中位数41,220美元，时薪中位数19.82美元。 美国O*NET同一2025年全国数据还显示：该职业年薪第10分位为32,220美元，第90分位为58,160美元；这是分布边界，不是起薪、到手收入或个人报价，也不能换算为中国工资。",
                "fact_refs": [
                  "wage",
                  "wage-boundary"
                ],
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial",
                  "wage"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "入门证据应展示批次核对、缺陷分流、产量记录、停机升级和交接，不以观看教程替代现场培训与授权。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "课程、工牌和岗位名称不自动授予设备启动、清堵、检修或隔离解除权限；以现场制度和授权为准。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.credentials",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "护罩、急停、隔离、材料规格、通道或交接状态不明时不得上机；应保持距离、保留现场状态并交由指定负责人处理。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国BLS预计该职业就业人数由2024年的46,500人降至2034年的40,400人，下降13%，同期年均空缺约4,700个。",
                "fact_refs": [
                  "employment"
                ],
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial",
                  "trend"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "是否值得进入应由纸面工单中的规格核对、缺陷分流、停手边界和记录质量决定，而不是只看体力或职位名称。",
                "id": "machine-feeders-and-offbearers.faq.12",
                "question_key": "career.faq.machine-feeders-and-offbearers.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
